---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout title="Customer Support & Help — TotalRecalls" description="Need help with TotalRecalls Downloader or Smart Search Engine? Contact our support team for license recovery, installation assistance, and troubleshooting." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Support" }]}>
  <h1>Support &amp; Customer Care</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    We build software for people who value ownership and privacy. When you reach out for help, you communicate
    directly with the software team in Montreal — never an automated chat bot or third-party call center.
  </p>

  <h2>Direct Email Contact</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Technical Questions, Bugs &amp; Diagnostics:</strong>{" "}
      <a href="mailto:support@totalrecalls.app">support@totalrecalls.app</a> — Mon–Fri, typical response within 24 hours.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Orders, Invoicing &amp; Merchant Inquiries:</strong>{" "}
      <a href="mailto:contact@totalrecalls.app">contact@totalrecalls.app</a> — Paddle transaction queries and volume licensing.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>License Key Recovery</h2>
  <p>
    If you purchased Downloader Pro, the Smart Search Engine (SSE) add-on, or the Bundle and cannot locate your
    license key email:
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>Search your inbox for receipts from <code>Paddle.com</code> or <code>help@paddle.com</code>.</li>
    <li>Check your spam and promotions folders for emails with the subject line <em>Your TotalRecalls License Key</em>.</li>
    <li>
      If still missing, email <a href="mailto:support@totalrecalls.app">support@totalrecalls.app</a> with the email address
      used at checkout and we will promptly resend your active license key and direct download links.
    </li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Machine Activation &amp; Reinstallations</h2>
  <p>
    Each Downloader Pro license includes up to <strong>3 personal device activations</strong> (for your desktop,
    laptop, or work computer). If you migrate to a new PC or reinstall Windows:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Download the application from our website or the Microsoft Store.</li>
    <li>Click <em>Upgrade to Pro</em> at the top right of the application header.</li>
    <li>Enter your original license key and click <em>Activate</em>.</li>
    <li>
      If you exceed your 3-machine seat allowance after replacing hardware, email support and we will reset your seat counter.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Bug Reporting &amp; Diagnostics Checklist</h2>
  <p>
    To help us resolve provider connection hurdles quickly, include these details in your email:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your Windows edition and version (e.g., Windows 11 Pro 64-bit).</li>
    <li>Whether you are using the Microsoft Store edition or the standalone portable ZIP.</li>
    <li>The specific AI provider involved (e.g., ChatGPT, Claude, DeepSeek).</li>
    <li>The exact text of any error badge shown in the app's export log window.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Pricing &amp; Our Try-Before-You-Buy Commitment</h2>
  <p>
    TotalRecalls is a one-time $24<span class="tr-usd">USD</span> purchase with no recurring subscription. We offer
    a fully functional Free Tier (covering ChatGPT, Claude, and Perplexity with 5 conversations each) so you can
    verify the download speed, local folder layout, and Markdown/JSON file fidelity on your own computer before
    spending any money. Review all plan details on our <a href="/#pricing">Pricing Section</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
